0010/extras/88f23021eb9bac345dc7d6a850368f5f.gif?t=1780880265\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/88f23021eb9bac345dc7d6a850368f5f.poster.avif?t=1780880265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/d60cc50a6dfc4d0b203dcf56bcde80cf.gif?t=1780880265\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/d60cc50a6dfc4d0b203dcf56bcde80cf.poster.avif?t=1780880265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Maker Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mythic Kart Maker is a fantasy Kart game where you make your own tracks while driving or from a top down perspective, &amp; then share those tracks with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/61a346e88903e0e9a3977df7355453eb.avif?t=1780880265\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Racing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay is like a mix of the racing games from a certain bandicoot &amp; a hedgehog that loves adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/4aa3206109e8084ff4e8e3ee64353fa1.avif?t=1780880265\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reminiscent of games from the 32 bit era - 3D tracks with pre-rendered billboard sprites. Easily add (not replace) your own character skins through included modding resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/058683a6237e19a008c7f10a1346947c.avif?t=1780880265\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boppin' fantasy tracks that sound like they're ripped from a lost game of the 90's. You can also add your own custom music to your tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/eed23dac34bf23f3489583897c0b82e6.gif?t=1780880265\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/eed23dac34bf23f3489583897c0b82e6.poster.avif?t=1780880265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/f9229dc86da8fcf5fbf8264dc806eafd.gif?t=1780880265\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/f9229dc86da8fcf5fbf8264dc806eafd.poster.avif?t=1780880265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/5467c76e0420a694815793284c7bdd53.poster.avif?t=1780880265\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020010/extras/5467c76e0420a694815793284c7bdd53.webm?t=1780880265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst